    {
      "subId": "7500902",
      "subQuestName": "查看龙伙伴找到的「宝物」",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750090201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750090201": {
            "id": "750090201",
            "speakerId": 21486,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750090202"
            ]
          },
          "750090202": {
            "id": "750090202",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这个小球…看起来像是零件之类的东西。你喜欢这个吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750090203"
            ]
          },
          "750090203": {
            "id": "750090203",
            "speakerId": 21486,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "唔…呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750090204"
            ]
          },
          "750090204": {
            "id": "750090204",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "虽然不是挖出来的东西，但毕竟还是在这里发现的…说不定也有很高的价值呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750090205"
            ]
          },
          "750090205": {
            "id": "750090205",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "离开的时候去问问吧！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7500906",
      "subQuestName": "回去问问奎皮亚",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750090601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750090601": {
            "id": "750090601",
            "speakerId": 21485,
            "speakerName": "奎皮亚",
            "text": "战果如何？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750090602"
            ]
          },
          "750090602": {
            "id": "750090602",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}找到了这个…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750090603"
            ]
          },
          "750090603": {
            "id": "750090603",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750090604"
            ]
          },
          "750090604": {
            "id": "750090604",
            "speakerId": 21485,
            "speakerName": "奎皮亚",
            "text": "让我看看…是不少见但难得的物件。保存完整，燃素流经的纹路也清晰可见。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750090605"
            ]
          },
          "750090605": {
            "id": "750090605",
            "speakerId": 21485,
            "speakerName": "奎皮亚",
            "text": "嗯。如果我出一万摩拉的话，你们愿意把这个东西交给我吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750090606"
            ]
          },
          "750090606": {
            "id": "750090606",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "欸？！难道我们真的找到了价值连城的珍贵龙遗物？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750090607"
            ]
          },
          "750090607": {
            "id": "750090607",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#我就知道{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}是个了不起的小家伙，能给我们带来好运！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750090608"
            ]
          },
          "750090608": {
            "id": "750090608",
            "speakerId": 21485,
            "speakerName": "奎皮亚",
            "text": "不，这东西并没有你想的那么珍贵。拿去龙遗物研究协会总部鉴定的话，根据我的判断，充其量也就值五千摩拉。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750090609"
            ]
          },
          "750090609": {
            "id": "750090609",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "我才不会上当呢，要是它真的只值五千摩拉，你又怎么会出一万收购？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750090610"
            ]
          },
          "750090610": {
            "id": "750090610",
            "speakerId": 21485,
            "speakerName": "奎皮亚",
            "text": "因为我很中意它独特的纹路。虽然它在别人眼中没有那么高的价值，但我愿意为了得到它而花费额外的金钱。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750090611"
            ]
          },
          "750090611": {
            "id": "750090611",
            "speakerId": 21485,
            "speakerName": "奎皮亚",
            "text": "可以说是怪癖，也可以说是收藏家的本性。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750090612"
            ]
          },
          "750090612": {
            "id": "750090612",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "唔…这么说好像也不是不能理解。而且相比三百摩拉的进场费，一万摩拉也相当多了呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750090613"
            ]
          },
          "750090613": {
            "id": "750090613",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "那我们要用它换一万摩拉吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750090614"
            ]
          },
          "750090614": {
            "id": "750090614",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "呜…呜呜。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750090615"
            ]
          },
          "750090615": {
            "id": "750090615",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}看起来不愿意的样子…是想自己留着吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750090616"
            ]
          },
          "750090616": {
            "id": "750090616",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "唔…呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750090619"
            ]
          },
          "750090619": {
            "id": "750090619",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#既然{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}不愿意，那我们还是自己留着好了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750090620"
            ]
          },
          "750090620": {
            "id": "750090620",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750090621"
            ]
          },
          "750090621": {
            "id": "750090621",
            "speakerId": 21485,
            "speakerName": "奎皮亚",
            "text": "#看来你们是看重{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}更甚摩拉了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750090622"
            ]
          },
          "750090622": {
            "id": "750090622",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#那当然啦，{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}也是我们的伙伴嘛。不过如果我们之后找到类似的东西…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750090623"
            ]
          },
          "750090623": {
            "id": "750090623",
            "speakerId": 21485,
            "speakerName": "奎皮亚",
            "text": "谢谢你们，不过收藏家的热情就像潮水，来得快退得也快。之后大概会迷上别的东西吧，但会是什么我也说不好。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750090624"
            ]
          },
          "750090624": {
            "id": "750090624",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "呀！呀呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750090625"
            ]
          },
          "750090625": {
            "id": "750090625",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}是在赞同她？我懂了，这就是收藏家之间的惺惺相惜吧！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750090626"
            ]
          },
          "750090626": {
            "id": "750090626",
            "speakerId": 21485,
            "speakerName": "奎皮亚",
            "text": "能得到这么聪颖的小嵴锋龙的认可，真是荣幸。买卖不成仁义在，今后如果想交流收藏的心得，不妨来找我聊聊。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750090627"
            ]
          },
          "750090627": {
            "id": "750090627",
            "speakerId": 21485,
            "speakerName": "奎皮亚",
            "text": "那就不耽搁几位了，祝好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7500908",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
